    "physical_description": "Kain panjang of cotton batik. Sapujagad design with different motifs and background elements to make a strong overall pattern. Pattern of gabah sinawur (husked grains of rice) with foliage, bird and butterfly motifs. Superimposed on this pattern, running diagonally across the cloth, are blue scrolled outline forming half-enclosed circles in each of which is another set of motifs of ceplok designs alternating with parang designs with circles based on the gringsing fish scale design.",
